d9477cefca9cad2","text":"- On 2023-09-22, reconnected with Calvin (\"Hey Calvin, good to catch up again!\"): told Calvin he'd been working on the engine of the vintage Mustang — thought he'd fixed it, but when he started it up he heard a weird noise — \"So disappointing after putting so much work in\" — and shared a photo of the engine (a car engine with a small engine), asking Calvin to take a look (details in ## Car mod workshop (2023-08-11)); Calvin sympathized (\"That must be disappointing after putting so much work into it\") and shared a photo of his red sports car (Ferrari) parked in a parking lot as \"a sign of my hard work and dedication\"; Dave: \"I love the way the sunlight hits this. It's definitely a great symbol of all your hard work. I bet you feel really proud when you look at it.\" and asked whether Calvin had any special memories with it; Calvin recalled an unforgettable summer drive (\"the wind blowing through my hair and the rush of freedom\") and said his trip to Japan was incredible — \"already longing to go back,\" \"an experience that made all the hard work worth it\" (Calvin's side in the New luxury car and Japan plan sections of /memories/calvin.md); Dave: \"That feeling of freedom in the summer is the best. A moment of reflection not only makes the journey interesting but also productive!\" — and asked whether any song from Calvin's childhood brings back memories; Calvin: \"there's this one song that always makes me smile. It played during a road trip with my dad and we had so much fun singing along to it.\"; Dave: \"Sounds awesome, Calvin! Road trips with family are always a treat. What's the name of the song?\"; Calvin: \"We used to rock a song by Tupac and Dr. Dre called 'California Love.' Ah, those were the days!\" (song details in the Music section of /memories/calvin.md); Dave: \"Sounds great, Cal! 'California Love' is a classic! Let me know if you wanna jam some music together!\" — inviting Calvin to jam some music together (details